e impostos de outros proprietários de terras que vão dos castelos para as cidades e defenda as suas próprias.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/716350/extras/d5e8c114d9eb6e403022be60b0c79c51.poster.avif?t=1764588000\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/716350/extras/d5e8c114d9eb6e403022be60b0c79c51.webm?t=1764588000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/716350/extras/d5e8c114d9eb6e403022be60b0c79c51.mp4?t=1764588000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
